    debug_symbol trackedEnough [BP-06h] type=0x69 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x00
    debug_symbol fram [BP-08h] type=0x69 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x00
    debug_symbol counter [BP-10h] type=0x69 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x00
    debug_symbol sawCrusader [BP-12h] type=0x69 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x00
    debug_symbol movement [BP-14h] type=0x69 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x00
    debug_symbol target [BP-16h] type=0x24 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x02
    debug_symbol range [BP-18h] type=0x69 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x00
